<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "SE\pc_keyboard.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島タイピング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>A mute<STYLE ID="1">―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Someone who, for some reason, can no longer speak.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "in_dream低.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\古郡家居間死体.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Back then, in the shock of losing </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and out of my own powerlessness, I tried to kill myself by biting my tongue.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Partly because it happened in a hospital, my life was, unfortunately, saved.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I did know that the odds of dying by biting your tongue are low, but back then I didn't have that much judgment left.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">I was allowed neither to live nor to die.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">From that moment on, I lost my voice.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">I have to go on living with this handicap on my back.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Ever since my suicide failed, I'd lost even the will to die.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A life of nothing but waiting for my lifespan to run out.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">For me at 15, a time far, far too long.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\病院.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">After about 3 months in the hospital, my mind was judged to have recovered to some extent, and I was discharged.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But that wasn't true.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Not only my positive thoughts but even my negative thoughts were gone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Only neutral thoughts, neither one nor the other, remained.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">No purpose, no pleasure, just passing the time.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">About being discharged, I had no positive thoughts and no negative feelings.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">All that was left to me was to obey the survival instinct that should have run out: eat, sleep, breathe.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\教室.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I did graduate from high school, for what it's worth.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But having lost my voice and given up on thinking, I was now just an ordinary person.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I, who was once called a genius girl, died back then.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">What did the people around me think of me like that?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The fact that I have to wonder what they thought... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">means nobody around me reached out.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My <STYLE ID="2">senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> saw me not as a genius girl but as one human being.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Now that I was no longer a genius girl, all expectations of me were gone.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">It was just as I'd thought.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Without the title of genius girl, the value of my existence is nil.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">After I graduated from high school, I neither went on to college nor found a job―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\pc_keyboard.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島タイピング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I shut myself in my room and did part-time work online.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Not that I was eager about it, and not that I felt negative about it either.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I just handled whatever was put in front of me, like work on an assembly line.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\gotmail.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "200" "PASS"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島パソコン見る.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">“</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'re fast and accurate, and a big help!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　We're going to be hiring full-time staff soon. Why don't you apply?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　The terms are―”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">An email like that came from the president of the company I worked part-time for.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I wrote a reply right away.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\pc_keyboard.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島パソコン見る横.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">“Thank you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">But I'd like to stay as I am now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">I'll keep working hard as a part-timer, and I hope you'll keep me on.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The salary and benefits on offer were excellent.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But I, the one who mattered, didn't have the energy for anything more.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">When you lose your dreams for the future, you let even the chance right in front of you slip away.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島マウス.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\duble_clicks.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Aware of all that, I clicked the reply button.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But knowing the president...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\gotmail.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島パソコン見る.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">“Are you sure that's what you want?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, you're turning 20 soon, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'re more capable than anyone else!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　There's no rush, so think it over </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">one</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> more time.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">20 years old―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So much time has already passed since then...</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">These 4 years have been really long.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">For the 4 years since I lost the title of genius girl, I've lived listlessly.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Just doing the work I was given, exactly as I was told.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Apart from meals, the toilet, and baths, I don't leave my room. I face the computer all day and move however others want me to.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">The only things I do of my own accord are eat, sleep, breathe―these three.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It suits me as I am now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The only thing driving me is the survival instinct that should have run out.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">When I'm short of breath, I breathe. When I'm sleepy, I sleep. When I'm hungry, I eat.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even a baby can do that.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\赤ちゃん.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I'm nothing more than a baby who can work a computer.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I can't even talk, so I really am a baby.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The world's number-one baby at working and earning money.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">No... in this world there are probably babies earning hundreds of times what I do as baby models.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Thinking about it that way, I'm just a baby with a sense of self after all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But I don't even mind that in itself.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Because I don't have enough energy to mind.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Anyway, that's it for today's work.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I'd done at least twice my quota.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Once I'm done moving the way others want me to, all that's left is to obey my survival instinct.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">When I'm hungry, I eat.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That's only natural.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Out of my room―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">out of the house―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I headed for the usual place.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\野球.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\食堂.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "2" "2000" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I went into the neighborhood diner alone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In the quiet diner, the sound of a baseball broadcast was strangely loud.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Erina</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">-chan, welcome! Work going well?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I nodded with a stiff smile at the owner, who knew me well.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So the muscles that make a smile get hard to move when you don't use them.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">While I waited for the food that came without my having to order, I tried moving my face muscles.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Just then, a young man and woman came in.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"This is it, right here! I hear it's famous for giant portions!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ehh? I can't eat that much!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The two of them sat down side by side at a table, all over each other.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">If that incident hadn't happened, would I have become a woman like that too, falling in love the normal way and getting all over someone?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The me of now can't even imagine that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No... I don't even have the energy to imagine it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">All I have is the instinct to eat, sleep, breathe.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Here you go! Sorry for the wait!</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\カップ置く音.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\かつ丼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">　Today's daily special, the extra-large pork-cutlet bowl, tripled!"</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\歓声.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">The cheers from the TV rang out as if to celebrate the food's arrival.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">For me, this amount was nothing much.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Back in high school, I used to get treated by </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> until her allowance ran out in a single day.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">My appetite, driven by my strong survival instinct, is the one thing that hasn't changed since then.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Besides the title of genius girl, the other way I differed from ordinary people was the size of this stomach.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">As always, I said "Itadakimasu" in my head and took a bite of the green onions on the very top of the bowl. [TN: itadakimasu: the words said before a meal]</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">...The scent of the green onions </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="か">stirred</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> up my appetite.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In silence I worked my chopsticks, tossing cutlet and rice into my mouth.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "1000"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\食堂.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Uh, that's amazing! Can you really eat all that!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The man from the couple who'd just come in spoke to me.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But as </STYLE>a mute<STYLE ID="1">, I can't make a sound.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I met his eyes briefly, didn't smile, gave a small bow, and went on eating.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Then I heard the whispering of the couple, who'd gone back to their seats without a word.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"What's with </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">that girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... So rude..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That mouth's only there to eat, huh."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "SE" "1000" "PASS"}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Only there to eat...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Hearing those words, I froze.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, hey, you two, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">she</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> can't talk. It's just how she is. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You shouldn't say things like that."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So the owner covered for me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh!? Seriously!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">At the owner's warning, the couple apologized meekly.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But my hands stayed frozen.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Erica.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">Even a baby can express pleasure and displeasure with its voice.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I can't even do that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Something less than a baby, good for nothing but eating.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">―I sent an order to my frozen hands and hurried to finish the rest of the pork-cutlet bowl.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\椅子から立つ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">And as I left the money and was about to walk out,</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Erina-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, heading home already?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　I had your usual dessert ready..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">So no one would see me crying, I hurried home.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I cried on my bed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">For the first time in a long while, something called emotion welled up in me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">My existence... what is it...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even at work, people who could replace me are a dime a dozen.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So what is someone like me even worth...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">How many years has it been since I questioned myself like this?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In elementary school, because of the gap between me and those around me, I did this over and over.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">For it to suddenly spring up now... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">means I still had some human feeling left in me.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But I'm refusing to accept it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Because if I accept it... I feel like I'll be crushed by sadness and helplessness again...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Why did my voice stop coming out?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Somewhere in my heart, I knew the reason.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Genius girl though I was, I couldn't save my </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I can't save anyone.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Then I'd rather not get involved with anyone at all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I don't want to communicate with anyone.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Those feelings must be what's driving a wedge into my vocal cords.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I should actually be able to speak.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But I'm afraid to use my voice.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">My useless voice... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'm afraid to hear it with my own ears.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The next morning, I sent a message to Mom, who'd gone to work.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">“I'm leaving home. Thank you for everything until now.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I'd become afraid of meeting people.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">To be precise, maybe I should say I'm afraid of meeting people I know.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even communication as small as meeting someone's eyes is painful for me.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">While it was still morning, I packed my things and withdrew half my savings.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I left that money on the table at home.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This is for my parents, who've taken care of me all this time.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Where will I go from here?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There's no way I have anywhere in mind.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">For now, if I take my laptop, I shouldn't run short of money anywhere I can get online.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Without waiting for a reply from Mom, I left home.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Just like </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, who suddenly left home 4 years ago.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I acted with a decisiveness that surprised even me.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\新幹線車内.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\新幹線.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">For now, maybe I'll just head for Tokyo or somewhere.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There, I should be able to find somewhere with an internet connection.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I can't think of anyone I know who lives in Tokyo.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Far too rash an idea for someone once called a genius girl.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If I end up dying in a ditch because of it, that's fine too.</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------